# Delivery patches. Generated with `git format-patch` from commits that are
# already in this history, copied here only to hand to a machine that pulls by
# patch rather than by remote. Committing them would duplicate the history as
# text, and there is a new one most sessions.
*.patch

# Delivery renders. Plan sheets and before/after comparisons built by
# tools/plot-track.ts and friends to hand to a human -- one or two most
# sessions, superseded by the next layout change, and reproducible from the
# track files that ARE committed. Same reasoning as the patches above.
*-before-after.png
track-plans*.png

# design benches (tools/bench) build output
tools/bench/dist/
